{%- comment -%}
  UBC SEO & GEO (Generative Engine Optimization) Layer
  - Geographic meta tags (Tampa Bay & Alafia River State Park, FL)
  - Dual-location BikeStore / LocalBusiness JSON-LD with OfferCatalog & ServiceArea
  - Contextual FAQPage JSON-LD for AI Overviews, ChatGPT, and Perplexity citations
  - Product MPN / UPC / System ID structured enrichment
{%- endcomment -%}

<meta name="geo.region" content="US-FL">
<meta name="geo.placename" content="Tampa, Florida">
<meta name="geo.position" content="28.0695;-82.4468">
<meta name="ICBM" content="28.0695, -82.4468">

<script type="application/ld+json">
